We deliver, install and test every package ourselves, so nothing arrives at your venue for you to figure out. On the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), a technician stays on site for the hours that matter. Pricing is listed in real euros on our [packages page](/packages/), ex VAT, not a vague quote-on-request.

