## What We Provide, and What We Don't

We provide sound, lighting, microphones, projectors and screens across five packages. We do not provide cameras, live streaming equipment, video conferencing hardware, or an LED video wall: our largest display is a single 60 inch LED screen on the MICE Pack, not a modular wall.

